# 词法器改动的边界：顶层的不配对引号，以及 NBT 里带引号的坏值。
#
# 2026-10-21 实测准备：
#   - 第一组：引号不在 {} 里，词法器仍然会拒（真服把它当普通文本）
#   - 第二组：引号在 {} 里，词法器放行，交给 NBT 解析器
--- console ---
say M00
scoreboard objectives add t dummy
summon armor_stand 2 4 0 {CustomName:"NBT_AS"}
say M01
scoreboard players set @e[type=armor_stand] t 1 "abc
say M02
scoreboard players set @e[type=armor_stand] t 1 {a:1 "b
say M03
entitydata @e[type=armor_stand] {a:1 "b
say M04
entitydata @e[type=armor_stand] {a:"b" c:1
say M05
entitydata @e[type=armor_stand] {a:1 b
say M06
entitydata @e[type=armor_stand] {a:1 b:
say M07
